WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:02.767
-Welcome back to
"The Tonight Show," everybody.

00:00:02.767 --> 00:00:09.501
Now, guys, one of the biggest
video games out

00:00:09.501 --> 00:00:11.834
right now is "Super Mario Bros.
Wonder."

00:00:11.834 --> 00:00:14.734
Everybody is talking about this.
It is the hottest new game.

00:00:14.734 --> 00:00:17.267
It's going to be during all
the holidays. It's fantastic.

00:00:17.267 --> 00:00:19.133
I thought it'd be fun to go
head-to-head against

00:00:19.133 --> 00:00:21.300
Tariq Trotter
in an online friend race

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:23.200
to see who the
"Super Mario Bros. Wonder"

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:26.167
champ is once and for all.

00:00:26.167 --> 00:00:28.534
Alright?
Now, before --

00:00:28.534 --> 00:00:31.567
Before we start, let's up
the ante a little bit, okay?

00:00:31.567 --> 00:00:34.534
[ Power-up sound plays ]

00:00:34.534 --> 00:00:36.567
Now, if I win the race,

00:00:36.567 --> 00:00:38.868
everyone on the Mario side
of the audience,

00:00:38.868 --> 00:00:41.234
the red side, will go home
with a copy of

00:00:41.234 --> 00:00:42.734
"Super Mario Bros. Wonder"

00:00:42.734 --> 00:00:46.033
and a brand-new
Nintendo Switch OLED.

00:00:46.033 --> 00:00:49.334
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:49.334 --> 00:00:52.234
OLED model.

00:00:52.234 --> 00:01:00.200
[ Cheers and applause continue ]

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:02.300
Everyone else will go home
empty-handed.

00:01:02.300 --> 00:01:05.934
[ Laughter ]
Alright, let's play the game.

00:01:05.934 --> 00:01:09.300
If Tariq wins,
everyone on the Yoshi side,

00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:10.667
the green side, gets the prize.

00:01:10.667 --> 00:01:12.834
-Two. You get two.

00:01:12.834 --> 00:01:16.267
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:16.267 --> 00:01:17.834
-You all have --

00:01:17.834 --> 00:01:21.534
[ Crowd booing each other ]

00:01:21.534 --> 00:01:23.968
-You all have red and green --

00:01:23.968 --> 00:01:28.701
[ Crowd chanting "Jimmy" ]

00:01:28.701 --> 00:01:32.601
You all have red and green
bandanas under your seat.

00:01:32.601 --> 00:01:34.367
You can grab them.
You can wave them around.

00:01:34.367 --> 00:01:36.334
Let's see the bandanas.
That's how you --

00:01:36.334 --> 00:01:38.200
Yeah. Then you can
just show your love.

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:42.534
Yeah. Swing them around.
Alright, you got it.

00:01:42.534 --> 00:01:44.734
Yeah, it's getting
rowdy out there.

00:01:44.734 --> 00:01:46.234
-Yeah, yeah.
-It's getting rowdy

00:01:46.234 --> 00:01:47.501
out there tonight.

00:01:47.501 --> 00:01:51.334
-Whoo! Come on, come on!

00:01:51.334 --> 00:01:52.667
[ Crowd cheering ]
-That's what I'm talking about.

00:01:52.667 --> 00:01:58.200
Yeah! Alright. Alright.
Here we go.

00:01:58.200 --> 00:01:59.534
Alright.
-Whoo!

00:01:59.534 --> 00:02:01.334
-Alright, here we go.

00:02:01.334 --> 00:02:03.701
Get ready for the race.
I'm going to be -- I'm Mario.

00:02:03.701 --> 00:02:08.100
Tariq, you are Yoshi.
First one to the flag wins.

00:02:08.100 --> 00:02:10.033
I am Elephant Mario here.

00:02:10.033 --> 00:02:14.701
♪♪

00:02:14.701 --> 00:02:16.667
[ Crowd cheering ]

00:02:16.667 --> 00:02:22.701
♪♪

00:02:22.701 --> 00:02:28.701
♪♪

00:02:28.701 --> 00:02:30.567
I got to take an elephant fruit.

00:02:36.467 --> 00:02:38.434
Oh! I got the Wonder Seed!

00:02:38.434 --> 00:02:44.234
♪♪

00:02:44.234 --> 00:02:50.033
♪♪

00:02:50.033 --> 00:02:51.467
-Did you get the Wonder Seed,
dude?

00:02:51.467 --> 00:02:53.934
-I thought I did.
-Did you get the Wonder Seed?

00:02:53.934 --> 00:02:55.634
-Yeah, yeah, I got it.

00:02:55.634 --> 00:03:01.400
♪♪

00:03:01.400 --> 00:03:07.067
♪♪

00:03:07.067 --> 00:03:08.634
-Come on, come on!

00:03:08.634 --> 00:03:15.334
♪♪

00:03:15.334 --> 00:03:16.901
[ Both laugh ]

00:03:16.901 --> 00:03:17.934
-Come on!

00:03:17.934 --> 00:03:19.868
Ohh!
-[ Screaming ]

00:03:19.868 --> 00:03:29.467
♪♪

00:03:29.467 --> 00:03:31.534
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:31.534 --> 00:03:37.868
♪♪

00:03:37.868 --> 00:03:39.467
-Well, well, well.

00:03:39.467 --> 00:03:41.767
♪♪

00:03:41.767 --> 00:03:45.667
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:45.667 --> 00:03:47.267
-Yo!

00:03:47.267 --> 00:03:54.133
♪♪

00:03:54.133 --> 00:04:01.067
♪♪

00:04:01.067 --> 00:04:04.834
I want to say
thank you very much.

00:04:04.834 --> 00:04:08.601
Mario won.
We won fair and square.

00:04:08.601 --> 00:04:11.367
Everyone on the Mario side
will be going home

00:04:11.367 --> 00:04:12.734
with "Super Mario Bros. Wonder"

00:04:12.734 --> 00:04:15.634
and a Nintendo Switch
OLED model right here.

00:04:15.634 --> 00:04:20.734
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:20.734 --> 00:04:24.033
But you know what? We're here
at the Tonight Show. Come on.

00:04:24.033 --> 00:04:26.434
Everybody is going home with
a Nintendo Switch...

00:04:26.434 --> 00:04:27.901
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:27.901 --> 00:04:32.634
"Super Mario Bros. Wonder" and
a Nintendo Switch OLED model!

00:04:32.634 --> 00:04:36.300
Our thanks to the geniuses at
Nintendo.

00:04:36.300 --> 00:04:37.734
"Super Mario Bros. Wonder"

00:04:37.734 --> 00:04:39.901
is available now
on Nintendo Switch.

00:04:39.901 --> 00:04:41.868
We'll be right back
with more "Tonight Show."

00:04:41.868 --> 00:04:43.467
Yeah!

